What if mania isn’t a malfunction - but a message from the psyche trying to heal?
In this long-form conversation, Jacob sits with author and teacher Sean Blackwell to explore bipolar disorder through the lenses of trauma, somatic healing, Kundalini, psychosis, and spiritual awakening. This is a grounded, compassionate, and unconventional look at the deeper meaning behind extreme psychological states.

@bipolarawake 

